WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.950
Under the Moon by Rowena Akanyemi.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.950
Chapter 1

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.950
AOL

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.950
500km over Europe.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.950
Ship OM45 moved north.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.950
In a room at the back of the ship, Kia watched the numbers

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.950
on the computer in front of him.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.950
Time for dinner?

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.950
Rilla said.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.950
The numbers changed quickly.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.950
And Kia's eyes didn't move.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.950
Rilla went across the room to his table.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.950
She began to watch the numbers too.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.950
What's wrong with a satellite?

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.950
She asked.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.950
She was a beautiful girl, about twenty years old,

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:11.950
with long black hair and big eyes.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.950
Nothing's wrong with a satellite.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.950
Kia answered quietly.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.000
It's the AOL.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:27.950
He began to write the numbers in the book on his table.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.950
Suddenly, the numbers stopped changing.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.950
Kia looked at Rilla.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.950
Over Europe, he said.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.950
It's happening.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:45.950
The AOL is breaking up.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.950
There are big holes in the AOL, and they're getting bigger.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.950
You're right.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:59.950
Shall we see Captain Seru now, before dinner?

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.950
Kia stood up.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:08.950
He was nearly two meters tall, with dark eyes and hair.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.950
Yes, come on.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.950
He said.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:18.950
Quickly, they went to Captain Seru's room.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.950
They waited at the door.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.950
Come in.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.950
Captain Seru called.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.950
She was a little woman with a fat face.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.950
Come in.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.950
Would you like a drink?

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.950
No, thank you.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.950
Kia answered.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:43.950
I'd like you to look at these numbers.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:48.950
Kia gave Captain Seru his book.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:52.950
Captain Seru looked at the numbers.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:57.950
Suddenly, her face changed.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:00.950
No, no, she said.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:02.950
I don't want to talk.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.950
It's late, and I'm tired.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.950
Sit down and have a drink.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.950
Kia and Rila sat down.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:18.950
There was a big window in Captain Seru's room.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:24.950
Kia looked out of the window at the dark sky.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.950
He saw the moon.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:32.950
It was cold and white in the dark sky.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.950
Captain Seru, he began.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.950
It's important.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:42.950
Look at those numbers carefully.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:47.950
The AOL is beginning to stop.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:53.950
Captain Seru stood up and put her hands in her pockets.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:59.950
She went to the window and looked at the sky.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.950
Three hundred years ago, Earth nearly died.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.950
Rila said.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:11.950
Earth stopped dying because of the AOL.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:18.950
But now, over Europe, the AOL is breaking up.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:23.950
We would like you to talk to Earth Commander.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:28.950
Captain Seru did not move.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.950
Do you remember a die?

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.950
She asked.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:36.950
She didn't wait for an answer.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:41.950
I was on his ship two years ago.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:49.950
One evening, the satellite gave us interesting numbers about the AOL.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:54.950
We went back to Earth and saw Earth Commander.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:58.950
Captain Seru stopped speaking.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:02.950
Rila looked at Kia.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:07.950
And then, she asked Captain Seru.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.950
Gog was angry.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.950
Very angry.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.950
Captain Seru said.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:20.950
In the end, he sent a die to the moon.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.950
A die is there now.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:28.950
Commander of the moon colony under the moon.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:33.950
Kia waited for a second or two.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.950
I know about a die.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:40.950
But we need to talk to Earth Commander again.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.950
These numbers are worse.

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:48.950
Captain Seru's face went red.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:51.950
You don't understand.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.950
I'm not going to talk to Gog.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:06:01.950
Last time, he sent me to our weather ship in the Antarctic.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:06.950
This is my first ship for two years.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:11.950
And Captain Seru began drinking.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.950
Kia stood up.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.950
Thank you, Captain Seru.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.950
Captain Seru said nothing.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:30.950
Kia and Rila left the room and walked slowly downstairs.

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:34.950
The ship was dark and quiet.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:41.950
It was eight o'clock and everybody was at dinner.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.950
What are we going to do next?

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.950
Rila asked.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.950
I need to talk to a die.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.950
Kia said.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:56.950
Okay, talk to a die.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.950
But he's far away on the moon colony.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.950
Rila said.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:06.950
Let's visit Commander Zadak.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.950
Zadak.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:11.950
Commander of Australia.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.950
He's famous.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.950
Yes.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.950
He's my father's friend.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:23.950
He worked with my father in Brazil ten years ago.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.950
Perhaps he can help us.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.950
Kia smiled.

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.950
Good.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:35.950
We return to Earth next week.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:38.950
I can phone a die from Kisangani.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.950
And then we can go to Australia.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:45.950
But now I'm hungry.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:49.000
Let's get some dinner.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.950
Chapter Two.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:13.950
Visit to Australia.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:18.950
On Friday, after three weeks in space,

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:25.950
Kia and Rila finished work and left ship OM45

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:30.950
on a space plane to Kisangani.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:32.950
Kia phoned a die.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:38.950
And Rila phoned Commander Zadak in Australia.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:45.950
The next morning, they took an aeroplane to Sydney.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:52.950
A taxi took them from the airport to Commander Zadak's office,

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:57.950
some kilometers north of Sydney.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.950
Wait for us here.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.950
Kia said to the taxi driver.

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:06.950
Kia and Rila walked to the gate.

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:11.950
About ten guards stood in front of the gate.

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:16.950
Across the road, a train waited.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:20.950
Rila OM45.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:26.950
Rila said, to see Commander Zadak at 430.

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.950
Let me call the commander's office.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.950
The guard said.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:36.950
Kia and Rila waited.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:38.950
It was hot.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.950
And Kia began to feel thirsty.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:44.950
The guard came back.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.950
I'm sorry, he said.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.950
The commander can't see you.

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:54.950
But I talked to the commander yesterday.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:56.950
Rila said.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:00.950
He wanted to see us at 430.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:04.950
The commander is leaving on the train in three minutes.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.950
The guard said.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.950
Can we wait and see him here?

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.950
Kia asked.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:13.950
No.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.950
The guard shouted.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:19.950
Get out of here.

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:23.950
Kia and Rila walked back to the taxi.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.950
Where's the driver?

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.950
Kia asked.

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:28.950
Look!

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:31.950
He's sitting by that wall.

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:33.950
Rila said.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:38.950
Just then, Commander Zadak came out of the gate.

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:46.950
He was a very tall, big man with blue eyes and a lot of white hair.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:54.950
Two guards marched in front of him and two guards marched behind him.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:58.950
They all carried guns.

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:02.950
There he is, Rila cried.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:04.950
Commander!

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:09.950
And she began to run along the road to him.

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:12.950
Commander Zadak did not stop.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:18.950
A guard opened the door of the train and the commander got in.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:22.950
Slowly the train began to move.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:27.950
Kia ran to the taxi and jumped in.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:32.950
Then he drove the taxi fast down the road.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:38.950
The taxi driver saw him and ran after him.

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:43.950
The train began to move faster.

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:49.950
Suddenly Kia drove the taxi off the road.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:54.950
He drove in front of the train and stopped.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:58.950
The train came nearer.

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:01.950
And then the train stopped.

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:04.950
Very near the taxi.

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:08.950
And some guards jumped off.

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:14.950
Kia opened the door and got out of the taxi.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:19.950
Put up your hands, the guards shouted.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:23.950
Two of the guards began to hit Kia.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:27.950
Stop that, someone shouted.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:30.950
Bring him over here.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:34.950
It was Commander Zadak.

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:38.950
Kia stood in front of the commander.

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.950
Just then Rila arrived.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:44.950
Oh, it's you.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:47.950
Commander Zadak said.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.950
He did not smile.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:54.950
Rila, your father's going to be angry.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:58.950
We want to talk to you, Commander.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:02.950
Commander Zadak said, it's very important.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:06.950
Very well, I'm listening.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:09.950
Kia began to talk.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:15.950
Two years ago, Adai told you about the holes in the AOL.

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:18.950
Now they are worse.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:22.950
The AOL is breaking up over Europe.

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:27.950
Please look at these numbers and this satellite picture.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:35.950
He gave his book to Commander Zadak and the commander looked at the numbers.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.950
It's important, Commander.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:45.950
Kia said, in ten years, Earth is going to die.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:49.950
You stop my train because of this?

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:52.950
Commander Zadak asked.

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:58.950
Two years ago, Adai talked to me about the AOL.

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:01.950
Then he talked to Earth Commander.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.950
And what happened?

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:05.950
Where is Adai now?

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:10.950
Is the moon colony helping the AOL?

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:15.950
We know about Adai, Commander, Rila said.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:20.950
But someone needs to talk to Earth Commander again.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:23.950
I'm going to talk to Gog about rain.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.950
I can tell you that.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:28.950
Earth needs rain.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:31.950
There was no rain last winter.

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:37.950
Half of Australia has no water and my trees here are dying.

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:41.950
Without rain, many people are going to die.

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:45.950
Is Gog going to understand that?

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:48.950
I don't know.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:52.950
Commander Zadak began to walk back to his train.

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:54.950
Move that taxi.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:57.950
He called to his guards.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:04.950
Some guards moved the taxi back to the road, and then they jumped onto the train again.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:07.950
The train began to move.

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:11.950
Okay, the taxi driver shouted.

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:14.950
What are you going to do next?

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:17.950
Drive my taxi into the river?

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.950
Kia smiled.

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:25.950
He took some money from his pocket and gave it to the taxi driver.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:28.950
The taxi driver looked at the money.

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:32.950
Okay, okay, he said.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.950
Where now?

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:36.950
Back to the airport?

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:39.950
Kia took Rila's hand.

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:41.950
Yes, he said.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:43.950
Let's get back to Kisangani.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.950
We can phone Adai again tomorrow.

00:15:47.000 --> 00:16:05.950
MUSIC

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:07.950
Chapter 3

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:10.950
Earth Commander

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:14.950
The next day in Kisangani

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:21.950
Kia and Rila waited quietly in an office in Gog's house.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:26.950
Suddenly, Commander Zadak came into the office

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:32.950
and gave some letters to the man behind the table.

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:38.950
He saw the two young people and stopped in front of them.

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:41.950
You again, he said.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:44.950
What are you doing here?

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:47.950
Kia stood up.

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:49.950
Good morning, Commander.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:54.950
We're here because we want to see Earth Commander.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:17:01.950
I saw Earth Commander some minutes ago and talked to him about rain.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:06.950
Zadak said quietly, but he didn't listen.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:10.950
Your Captain Seru was here earlier this morning

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:15.950
and began to tell him about the holes in the AOL.

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:20.950
But Gog doesn't want to hear about our planet.

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:23.950
He's always talking about Mars.

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:28.950
In the end, he's going to destroy Earth.

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:33.950
Please help us, Rila cried.

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:36.950
Come and see Gog with us.

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:38.950
No.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:44.950
Zadak looked at Kia and then at Rila with his blue eyes.

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:47.950
I'm not talking to Gog again.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:52.950
And you, Gog isn't going to listen to you.

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:57.950
Be careful and good luck.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:04.950
Commander Zadak opened the door and left the office.

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:07.950
Rila looked at Kia.

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:10.950
Earth Commander is a difficult man.

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:13.950
I don't understand him.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.950
Everyone is afraid of him.

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:18.950
Kia said.

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:22.950
And Commander Zadak isn't going to help us.

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:25.950
Kia and Rila waited.

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:28.950
They waited and waited.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:34.950
At nearly twelve o'clock, a guard came into the office.

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:38.950
Come, he said.

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:42.950
Kia and Rila went with the guard.

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:49.950
The house was big and old with big windows and many doors.

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:54.950
The guard went downstairs and opened one of the doors.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:58.950
There was nobody in the room.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:04.950
Wait here, the guard said, and left.

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:10.950
Kia and Rila sat down on the expensive green and black chairs

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:14.950
and looked at the expensive flowers on the tables.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:18.950
There were no windows in this room.

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:25.950
Suddenly, the door opened and a tall fat woman came in.

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:30.950
Her name was Belle and she was Gog's wife.

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:38.950
She had a lot of long red hair and she wore an expensive blue dress.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:41.950
Belle liked expensive things.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:44.950
She carried a cat.

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:48.950
The cat was black and white.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:53.950
Half its face was black and half was white.

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:59.950
Half its body was black and half was white.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.950
Why are you here?

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:05.950
Why do you want to see Earth, Commander?

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:07.950
She asked.

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:09.950
Rila stood up.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:11.950
How do you do?

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:13.950
She said.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:18.950
We want to talk to Earth, Commander, about the AOL.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:22.950
We have new numbers from the satellite.

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:25.950
Belle's face was red.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:34.950
The AOL Earth, Commander, knows about the AOL and he is the best man.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:39.950
Excuse me, Kia said quietly.

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:43.950
We want to help Earth, Commander.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:46.950
Belle began to laugh.

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:49.950
Help! You!

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:53.950
The cat jumped down and walked across the room.

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:55.950
How can you help?

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:58.950
Why can't you understand?

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:03.950
Listen, Earth, Commander is working on the spaceship for Mars.

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:07.950
It's difficult and expensive work.

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:13.950
The cat jumped onto Rila's chair and looked at her with its yellow eyes.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:23.950
Two years ago, a guy wanted more money for the AOL and Earth, Commander, sent him to the colony under the moon.

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:26.950
Now you're talking about the AOL.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:30.950
Do you want to go to the moon too?

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:35.950
The door opened again and a different guard came in.

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:39.950
Excuse me, Earth, Commander, is ready now.

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:41.950
Belle stood up.

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:44.950
You can see Earth, Commander, now.

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:46.950
She said coldly.

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:51.950
But you're going to be sorry.

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:54.950
The guard opened a different door.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:22:02.950
And Belle and the cat went into a beautiful room with expensive, very old tables and chairs.

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:06.950
Rila and Keir went in behind them.

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:11.950
There were no windows in the room but a lot of pictures.

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:19.950
There was Gog, the richest man on Earth and the worst man on Earth.

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:25.000
He was tall and fat and without much hair.

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:32.950
He sat behind a big table with a television, three computers and five telephones.

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:38.950
He watched the television and didn't look at Keir or Rila.

00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:47.000
Two guards with guns stood behind him and two more guards stood near the door.

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:50.950
Here they are, Belle said.

00:22:51.000 --> 00:22:52.950
They aren't friends.

00:22:53.000 --> 00:22:54.950
Oh no.

00:22:55.000 --> 00:22:58.950
They want to talk about the AOL, of course.

00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:01.950
No one understands about Mars.

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:02.950
That's all right.

00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:04.950
That's all the right.

00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:06.950
Gog said quickly.

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:08.950
And then he looked up.

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:12.950
First at Rila and then at Keir.

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:15.950
His eyes were cold and green.

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:18.950
I know about you too.

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:23.950
He said, your captain told me about you.

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:27.950
Your famous two children.

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:30.950
You want to help Planet Earth.

00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:32.950
Is that right?

00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:34.950
He waited.

00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:42.000
The cat jumped onto his table and sat down in front of the television.

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:44.950
Yes, Commander.

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:45.950
Keir began.

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.950
The AOL is breaking up.

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:50.950
When?

00:23:51.000 --> 00:23:51.950
Tonight?

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:52.950
Tomorrow?

00:23:53.000 --> 00:23:54.950
Gog said angrily.

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:59.950
I heard this old story two years ago from Adai.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:03.950
Everyone comes here and wants money.

00:24:04.000 --> 00:24:05.950
Money for the AOL.

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:07.950
Money for rain.

00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:10.950
Money for the moon colony.

00:24:11.000 --> 00:24:13.950
But I am Earth Commander.

00:24:14.000 --> 00:24:16.950
And you are nobody.

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:19.950
I know about the AOL.

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:24.950
And the AOL is good for a hundred years.

00:24:25.000 --> 00:24:26.950
But the satellite.

00:24:27.000 --> 00:24:28.950
Keir began again.

00:24:29.000 --> 00:24:30.950
Big quiet.

00:24:31.000 --> 00:24:31.950
Gog cried.

00:24:32.000 --> 00:24:34.950
I am Earth Commander.

00:24:35.000 --> 00:24:38.950
I'm not going to give money for the AOL.

00:24:39.000 --> 00:24:40.950
Or for rain.

00:24:41.000 --> 00:24:43.950
Or for the moon.

00:24:44.000 --> 00:24:46.950
Gog looked at the guards near the door.

00:24:47.000 --> 00:24:48.950
Take them.

00:24:49.000 --> 00:24:50.950
Take them away.

00:24:51.000 --> 00:24:54.950
I don't want to hear them.

00:24:55.000 --> 00:24:58.950
The guards moved behind Keir and Rilla.

00:24:59.000 --> 00:25:01.950
And Bell began to laugh.

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:03.950
Goodbye.

00:25:04.000 --> 00:25:07.950
She said, you're not going to the moon.

00:25:08.000 --> 00:25:10.950
You're going to prison.

00:25:11.000 --> 00:25:17.950
You can talk about the holes in the AOL there.

00:25:18.000 --> 00:25:19.950
Chapter 4.

00:25:20.000 --> 00:25:23.950
Prison 888.

00:25:24.000 --> 00:25:30.950
Commander Zaduk was in his room at the biggest hotel in Kisangani.

00:25:31.000 --> 00:25:35.950
Suddenly he heard the phone.

00:25:36.000 --> 00:25:37.950
Commander.

00:25:38.000 --> 00:25:40.950
Someone said very quietly.

00:25:41.000 --> 00:25:43.950
A man and a woman.

00:25:44.000 --> 00:25:51.950
From ship OM45 in prison 888.

00:25:52.000 --> 00:25:54.950
The phone went dead.

00:25:55.000 --> 00:26:01.950
Zaduk put the phone down, stood up and left his room.

00:26:02.000 --> 00:26:09.950
Prison 888 was a big white building without windows near Gog's house.

00:26:10.000 --> 00:26:12.950
There were a lot of guards at the gate.

00:26:13.000 --> 00:26:17.950
And some more guards marched past the building.

00:26:18.000 --> 00:26:21.950
All the guards carried guns.

00:26:22.000 --> 00:26:27.950
Commander Zaduk walked across the road to the prison.

00:26:28.000 --> 00:26:30.950
I want to visit someone.

00:26:31.000 --> 00:26:34.950
My name is Commander Zaduk.

00:26:35.000 --> 00:26:36.950
I'm sorry, Commander.

00:26:37.000 --> 00:26:40.950
A guard said, we can't open the gate.

00:26:41.000 --> 00:26:44.950
Nobody can go in without a letter from Earth Commander.

00:26:45.000 --> 00:26:48.950
That's all right, Zaduk said.

00:26:49.000 --> 00:26:52.950
And walked along the road past the prison.

00:26:53.000 --> 00:26:55.950
A guard ran behind him.

00:26:56.000 --> 00:26:57.950
Excuse me, Commander.

00:26:58.000 --> 00:26:59.950
He said quickly.

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:01.950
Please come back tonight.

00:27:02.000 --> 00:27:05.950
I can open the back gate at midnight.

00:27:06.000 --> 00:27:12.950
You can see the two people from ship OM45.

00:27:13.000 --> 00:27:14.950
Zaduk looked at the guard.

00:27:15.000 --> 00:27:17.950
Your captain is going to kill you.

00:27:18.000 --> 00:27:20.950
The guard smiled.

00:27:21.000 --> 00:27:26.950
My captain phoned you about the two people from OM45.

00:27:27.000 --> 00:27:31.950
He's the brother of Captain Seru.

00:27:32.000 --> 00:27:34.950
Zaduk didn't smile.

00:27:35.000 --> 00:27:40.950
The prison commander is going to kill you and your captain.

00:27:41.000 --> 00:27:42.950
It doesn't matter.

00:27:43.000 --> 00:27:46.950
The guard said, we want to help.

00:27:47.000 --> 00:27:53.950
Midnight, Zaduk said, and walked away.

00:27:54.000 --> 00:27:59.950
At midnight, there were four guards at the front gate of prison 888.

00:28:00.000 --> 00:28:04.950
And there was one guard at the back gate.

00:28:05.000 --> 00:28:09.950
The guard opened the gate and Zaduk went in.

00:28:10.000 --> 00:28:13.950
The guard said nothing.

00:28:14.000 --> 00:28:18.950
They walked downstairs into a big room.

00:28:19.000 --> 00:28:22.950
A lot of prisoners slept on the floor because there were no beds.

00:28:23.000 --> 00:28:25.950
There were no beds or chairs.

00:28:26.000 --> 00:28:31.950
Kia and Rilla sat on the floor near the door.

00:28:32.000 --> 00:28:34.950
You can talk for five minutes.

00:28:35.000 --> 00:28:38.950
The guard said quietly.

00:28:39.000 --> 00:28:43.950
The next guard arrives at 1215.

00:28:44.000 --> 00:28:46.950
Kia and Rilla stood up.

00:28:47.000 --> 00:28:51.950
Good evening, Commander, they said.

00:28:52.000 --> 00:28:54.950
Zaduk looked at the prisoners.

00:28:55.000 --> 00:28:57.950
Why are all these people here?

00:28:58.000 --> 00:29:00.950
He said to Kia and Rilla.

00:29:01.000 --> 00:29:04.950
They're in prison because Gog doesn't like them.

00:29:05.000 --> 00:29:06.950
I talked to Gog about rain.

00:29:07.000 --> 00:29:12.950
I talked to him about the AOL, but he never listens.

00:29:13.000 --> 00:29:19.950
Today, someone told me about some fires in the new forest here in Africa.

00:29:20.000 --> 00:29:24.950
But Gog doesn't want to hear about those fires.

00:29:25.000 --> 00:29:27.950
Zaduk laughed angrily.

00:29:28.000 --> 00:29:32.950
And he doesn't want to hear about my trees in Australia.

00:29:33.000 --> 00:29:35.950
He never listens to me.

00:29:36.000 --> 00:29:42.950
He's always thinking about Mars, not about our beautiful planet Earth.

00:29:43.000 --> 00:29:46.950
Kia listened carefully.

00:29:47.000 --> 00:29:49.950
Take it easy, Commander.

00:29:50.000 --> 00:29:54.950
He said quietly, please talk to Adai.

00:29:55.000 --> 00:29:56.950
Adai wants to help.

00:29:57.000 --> 00:30:00.950
He can come back from the moon and help you.

00:30:01.000 --> 00:30:06.950
Now, Zaduk said, I found Adai this afternoon.

00:30:07.000 --> 00:30:09.950
He's a good man and he wants to help.

00:30:10.000 --> 00:30:11.950
But I don't need help.

00:30:12.000 --> 00:30:14.950
I'm going to stop Gog.

00:30:15.000 --> 00:30:18.950
I'm going to kill him.

00:30:19.000 --> 00:30:22.950
Kia closed his eyes for a minute.

00:30:23.000 --> 00:30:25.950
Gog's guards have guns.

00:30:26.000 --> 00:30:29.950
They can kill you, Commander, he said.

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:32.950
You need more people to help.

00:30:33.000 --> 00:30:34.950
Wait for Adai.

00:30:35.000 --> 00:30:38.950
He can help you to look for more people.

00:30:39.000 --> 00:30:43.950
Now, Kia, Zaduk said quietly,

00:30:44.000 --> 00:30:46.950
I don't want more people.

00:30:47.000 --> 00:30:50.950
Adai can come back to Earth after Gog is dead.

00:30:51.000 --> 00:30:53.950
After I'm dead, perhaps.

00:30:54.000 --> 00:30:57.950
I don't want Adai to die, too.

00:30:58.000 --> 00:31:01.950
Excuse me, Commander, the guard said.

00:31:02.000 --> 00:31:04.950
He looked at the clock near the door.

00:31:05.000 --> 00:31:07.950
Okay, let's go.

00:31:08.000 --> 00:31:10.950
Zaduk said to the guard.

00:31:11.000 --> 00:31:13.950
He looked at Rilla and then at Kia.

00:31:14.000 --> 00:31:16.950
His eyes were very blue.

00:31:17.000 --> 00:31:20.950
Goodbye, he said.

00:31:21.000 --> 00:31:24.950
Goodbye, Commander, Kia said.

00:31:25.000 --> 00:31:28.950
Be careful, Rilla cried.

00:31:29.000 --> 00:31:33.950
And good luck.

00:31:34.000 --> 00:31:38.950
Early that morning, Earth Commander's house was quiet.

00:31:39.000 --> 00:31:41.950
A guard opened the door.

00:31:42.000 --> 00:31:45.950
Good morning, Commander Zaduk, he said.

00:31:46.000 --> 00:31:48.950
Earth Commander isn't in his office.

00:31:49.000 --> 00:31:51.950
That's all right, Zaduk said.

00:31:52.000 --> 00:31:54.950
I can wait.

00:31:55.000 --> 00:31:58.950
Zaduk went upstairs and waited.

00:31:59.000 --> 00:32:03.950
At eight o'clock, Bell came into the room.

00:32:04.000 --> 00:32:07.950
Good morning, Commander, she said.

00:32:08.000 --> 00:32:09.950
You're early this morning.

00:32:10.000 --> 00:32:12.950
Are you happier today?

00:32:13.000 --> 00:32:16.950
Earth Commander was fairly angry with you yesterday.

00:32:17.000 --> 00:32:22.950
Don't begin talking about the rain or the AOL today.

00:32:23.000 --> 00:32:27.950
Zaduk smiled, but his blue eyes were cold.

00:32:28.000 --> 00:32:30.950
No, he said.

00:32:31.000 --> 00:32:35.950
I'm not going to talk about rain today.

00:32:36.000 --> 00:32:39.950
Just then, Gog came into the room.

00:32:40.000 --> 00:32:42.950
He looked at Zaduk.

00:32:43.000 --> 00:32:44.950
What's wrong?

00:32:45.000 --> 00:32:49.950
Why are you here at eight o'clock in the morning?

00:32:50.000 --> 00:32:53.950
Zaduk took his gun from his pocket.

00:32:54.000 --> 00:32:57.950
Gog saw the gun and his face went white.

00:32:58.000 --> 00:33:01.950
His eyes were dark and afraid.

00:33:02.000 --> 00:33:06.950
For a second, nobody moved.

00:33:07.000 --> 00:33:12.950
Suddenly, Bell's black and white cat ran into the room.

00:33:13.000 --> 00:33:15.950
God's! God's!

00:33:16.000 --> 00:33:17.950
Bell shouted.

00:33:18.000 --> 00:33:24.950
The cat jumped at Zaduk, and Zaduk hit the cat away from him.

00:33:25.000 --> 00:33:32.950
Bell ran across the room to Gog, and Zaduk, at that second, shot at Gog.

00:33:33.000 --> 00:33:35.950
But Bell was between him and Gog.

00:33:36.000 --> 00:33:40.950
She gave a cry and fell to the floor.

00:33:41.000 --> 00:33:45.950
Her hair looked very red on the black floor.

00:33:46.000 --> 00:33:48.950
No, Gog cried.

00:33:49.000 --> 00:33:51.950
You shot the Bell!

00:33:52.000 --> 00:33:58.950
Three guards ran into the room with their big guns and stood in front of Gog.

00:33:59.000 --> 00:34:00.950
Kill him!

00:34:01.000 --> 00:34:06.950
Gog shouted and began to help Bell.

00:34:07.000 --> 00:34:11.950
Zaduk looked at the guards and then at Bell and Gog.

00:34:12.000 --> 00:34:13.950
Kia was right.

00:34:14.000 --> 00:34:16.950
He was going to die.

00:34:17.000 --> 00:34:19.950
I'm sorry, Kia.

00:34:20.000 --> 00:34:21.950
I'm sorry, Adai.

00:34:22.000 --> 00:34:24.950
He said quietly.

00:34:25.000 --> 00:34:28.950
The guards shot Zaduk.

00:34:29.000 --> 00:34:34.950
Slowly, he fell to the floor.

00:34:35.000 --> 00:34:37.950
Chapter 5

00:34:38.000 --> 00:34:41.950
Forest Fires

00:34:42.000 --> 00:34:47.950
Later that morning, four guards took Rilla to Gog's office.

00:34:48.000 --> 00:34:53.950
His face looked tired, and his eyes were red.

00:34:54.000 --> 00:34:57.950
Leave us, he said to the guards.

00:34:58.000 --> 00:35:00.950
Then he looked at Rilla.

00:35:01.000 --> 00:35:03.950
Tell me about Kia.

00:35:04.000 --> 00:35:06.950
When did you first meet him?

00:35:07.000 --> 00:35:09.950
Is Zaduk his friend?

00:35:10.000 --> 00:35:12.950
What do they talk about?

00:35:13.000 --> 00:35:17.950
Rilla looked down at the floor and said nothing.

00:35:18.000 --> 00:35:20.950
Come on, tell me.

00:35:21.000 --> 00:35:23.950
Gog said angrily.

00:35:24.000 --> 00:35:28.950
He waited, but Rilla said nothing.

00:35:29.000 --> 00:35:31.950
Tell me about Zaduk then.

00:35:32.000 --> 00:35:35.950
Your father and commander Zaduk were friends.

00:35:36.000 --> 00:35:40.950
Now, you're talking to Zaduk about the AOL.

00:35:41.000 --> 00:35:42.950
I know that.

00:35:43.000 --> 00:35:45.950
What is Zaduk saying?

00:35:46.000 --> 00:35:50.950
Why? Why do you want to know about Commander Zaduk?

00:35:51.000 --> 00:35:53.950
Rilla asked.

00:35:54.000 --> 00:35:56.950
I'm asking the questions, not you.

00:35:57.000 --> 00:35:58.950
Gog said.

00:35:59.000 --> 00:36:02.950
Did you see Zaduk yesterday?

00:36:03.000 --> 00:36:07.950
The AOL is important, not Commander Zaduk.

00:36:08.000 --> 00:36:10.950
Rilla said.

00:36:11.000 --> 00:36:14.950
Gog watched Rilla carefully.

00:36:15.000 --> 00:36:17.950
Zaduk is dead.

00:36:18.000 --> 00:36:19.950
No!

00:36:20.000 --> 00:36:21.950
Rilla cried.

00:36:22.000 --> 00:36:24.950
He is dead.

00:36:25.000 --> 00:36:26.950
Gog said again.

00:36:27.000 --> 00:36:31.950
You lost your friend here in this building early this morning.

00:36:32.000 --> 00:36:35.950
My guards shot him.

00:36:36.000 --> 00:36:38.950
Rilla's face went white.

00:36:39.000 --> 00:36:40.950
What happened?

00:36:41.000 --> 00:36:42.950
Tell me.

00:36:43.000 --> 00:36:45.950
I'm going to tell you one thing.

00:36:46.000 --> 00:36:47.950
Gog said angrily.

00:36:48.000 --> 00:36:51.950
I'm going to destroy Australia.

00:36:52.000 --> 00:36:56.950
I'm going to burn Zaduk's new forest there.

00:36:57.000 --> 00:36:59.950
You can tell all your friends.

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:05.950
Zaduk wanted to kill me, but I killed him.

00:37:06.000 --> 00:37:10.950
He wanted money for rain, money for the AOL.

00:37:11.000 --> 00:37:13.950
And now he's dead.

00:37:14.000 --> 00:37:18.950
You can tell all those prisoners in Prison 888.

00:37:19.000 --> 00:37:23.950
They wanted to stop me, but they can't now.

00:37:24.000 --> 00:37:26.950
I'm going to Mars.

00:37:27.000 --> 00:37:30.950
Bell always wanted to go to Mars.

00:37:31.000 --> 00:37:34.950
He began to hit the table with his hand.

00:37:35.000 --> 00:37:38.950
I'm going to leave this dead planet.

00:37:39.000 --> 00:37:41.950
Nobody can stop me.

00:37:42.000 --> 00:37:45.950
You're crazy, Rilla said.

00:37:46.000 --> 00:37:51.950
You killed Zaduk, but one day someone is going to kill you.

00:37:52.000 --> 00:37:54.950
Gog stood up.

00:37:55.000 --> 00:37:57.950
His face was tired and he looked ill.

00:37:58.000 --> 00:38:01.950
Be quiet, he said.

00:38:02.000 --> 00:38:04.950
The guards take her away.

00:38:05.000 --> 00:38:07.950
Back to 888.

00:38:08.000 --> 00:38:12.950
The guards came in and took Rilla out.

00:38:13.000 --> 00:38:14.950
What happened?

00:38:15.000 --> 00:38:16.950
She asked them.

00:38:17.000 --> 00:38:19.950
Commander Zaduk is dead.

00:38:20.000 --> 00:38:23.950
Why is Gog angry?

00:38:24.000 --> 00:38:26.950
The guards said nothing.

00:38:27.000 --> 00:38:34.950
But after they returned to the gate of 888, a guard said to Rilla very quietly,

00:38:35.000 --> 00:38:37.950
Bell is dead.

00:38:38.000 --> 00:38:45.950
Zaduk didn't shoot Gog, but he shot Bell before the guards shot him.

00:38:46.000 --> 00:38:52.950
A guard took Rilla into the prison and soon she was with Keir again.

00:38:53.000 --> 00:38:54.950
What happened?

00:38:55.000 --> 00:38:57.950
Keir asked, tell me.

00:38:58.000 --> 00:39:02.950
Rilla put her hands over her face and began to cry.

00:39:03.000 --> 00:39:05.950
Zaduk is dead.

00:39:06.000 --> 00:39:07.950
She began.

00:39:08.000 --> 00:39:10.950
He didn't kill Gog.

00:39:11.000 --> 00:39:14.950
He killed Bell before the guards shot him.

00:39:15.000 --> 00:39:20.950
And now Gog is going to destroy Australia.

00:39:21.000 --> 00:39:24.950
Keir sat down on the floor next to Rilla.

00:39:25.000 --> 00:39:27.950
His face was sad.

00:39:28.000 --> 00:39:29.950
Don't cry.

00:39:30.000 --> 00:39:33.950
He said quietly.

00:39:34.000 --> 00:39:38.950
Three or four prisoners came across the room.

00:39:39.000 --> 00:39:40.950
What's the matter?

00:39:41.000 --> 00:39:42.950
They asked.

00:39:43.000 --> 00:39:44.950
Zaduk is dead.

00:39:45.000 --> 00:39:49.950
Keir said, but Bell is dead too.

00:39:50.000 --> 00:39:51.950
What's going to happen next?

00:39:52.000 --> 00:39:57.950
Someone asked, but nobody answered.

00:39:58.000 --> 00:40:02.950
The next afternoon, Captain Seru's brother

00:40:03.000 --> 00:40:07.950
took Keir and Rilla to a little room at the back of the prison.

00:40:08.000 --> 00:40:11.950
They sat down, and five minutes later,

00:40:12.000 --> 00:40:14.950
Captain Seru arrived.

00:40:15.000 --> 00:40:17.950
Nobody smiled.

00:40:18.000 --> 00:40:20.950
You are right, Captain.

00:40:21.000 --> 00:40:22.950
Keir said.

00:40:23.000 --> 00:40:28.950
Gog sent us to prison because we told him about the holes in the AOL.

00:40:29.000 --> 00:40:31.950
Seru smiled.

00:40:32.000 --> 00:40:35.950
You were right, Keir, she said.

00:40:36.000 --> 00:40:38.950
Those satellite numbers were very bad.

00:40:39.000 --> 00:40:44.950
I began to tell Gog, but he didn't listen to me.

00:40:45.000 --> 00:40:48.950
Would you like some coffee and some sandwiches?

00:40:49.000 --> 00:40:50.950
Seru's brother asked.

00:40:51.000 --> 00:40:53.950
Yes, please, Seru said.

00:40:54.000 --> 00:40:56.950
I'm hungry.

00:40:57.000 --> 00:40:59.950
She looked at Keir and Rilla.

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:02.950
Things are very bad.

00:41:03.000 --> 00:41:04.950
What's happening?

00:41:05.000 --> 00:41:06.950
Rilla asked.

00:41:07.000 --> 00:41:10.950
You know about Zaduk and Bell?

00:41:11.000 --> 00:41:14.950
Yes, Gog told Rilla yesterday.

00:41:15.000 --> 00:41:16.950
Keir said.

00:41:17.000 --> 00:41:21.950
Seru smiled, but her eyes were not happy.

00:41:22.000 --> 00:41:25.950
Gog talked to me this morning, she said.

00:41:26.000 --> 00:41:32.950
Her brother came in with the coffee and sandwiches, and Seru began to eat.

00:41:33.000 --> 00:41:38.950
Gog wants to know about Zaduk and about you, she said.

00:41:39.000 --> 00:41:44.950
He's going to kill us all, I think, before he goes to Mars.

00:41:45.000 --> 00:41:48.950
Suddenly, Rilla felt ill.

00:41:49.000 --> 00:41:52.950
I can't eat now, she cried.

00:41:53.000 --> 00:41:56.950
But she took some coffee and began to drink.

00:41:57.000 --> 00:41:59.950
Let's get out of here, she said.

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:05.950
Perhaps we can get a plane to Brazil and go to my family.

00:42:06.000 --> 00:42:08.950
Difficult, Seru said.

00:42:09.000 --> 00:42:15.950
Last night, fires began in the new forest in Europe, and they're moving across Europe.

00:42:16.000 --> 00:42:19.950
The fires in Africa are burning fast.

00:42:20.000 --> 00:42:25.950
Gog began to destroy Zaduk's forest in Australia yesterday.

00:42:26.000 --> 00:42:27.950
Did you phone a die?

00:42:28.000 --> 00:42:29.950
Keir asked.

00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:31.950
A die?

00:42:32.000 --> 00:42:34.950
You never stopped talking about a die.

00:42:35.000 --> 00:42:36.950
What can he do?

00:42:37.000 --> 00:42:37.950
Rilla said.

00:42:38.000 --> 00:42:40.950
She felt angry.

00:42:41.000 --> 00:42:43.950
Seru looked at Rilla for a minute.

00:42:44.000 --> 00:42:47.950
Yes, I phoned a die before I came here.

00:42:48.000 --> 00:42:52.950
I told him about Zaduk and Bell and about the fires.

00:42:53.000 --> 00:42:55.950
He asked about you, Keir.

00:42:56.000 --> 00:43:02.950
He can't come down at Kiss and Garnie Airport, because Gog is there with a lot of his guards.

00:43:03.000 --> 00:43:07.950
Ship Marsfall is nearly ready and Gog is watching it.

00:43:08.000 --> 00:43:12.950
He wants to leave Earth tomorrow.

00:43:13.000 --> 00:43:14.950
How can a die help us?

00:43:15.000 --> 00:43:16.950
Rilla asked.

00:43:17.000 --> 00:43:20.950
He can't shoot all the guards here.

00:43:21.000 --> 00:43:23.950
Captain Seru finished the last sandwich.

00:43:24.000 --> 00:43:27.950
Let's leave that to a die, she said.

00:43:28.000 --> 00:43:30.950
We can do nothing.

00:43:31.000 --> 00:43:33.950
Are you going to stay here?

00:43:34.000 --> 00:43:35.950
Keir asked.

00:43:36.000 --> 00:43:38.950
Yes, Seru answered.

00:43:39.000 --> 00:43:44.950
A die is coming to the prison after he arrives on Earth.

00:43:45.000 --> 00:43:48.950
Oh yes, Rilla said tiredly.

00:43:49.000 --> 00:43:50.950
But when?

00:43:51.000 --> 00:43:54.950
Gog can kill us before a die comes.

00:43:55.000 --> 00:43:56.950
No, he can't.

00:43:57.000 --> 00:43:59.950
Seru's brother said.

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:03.950
You can stay here in this room.

00:44:04.000 --> 00:44:06.950
Gog's guards are all afraid.

00:44:07.000 --> 00:44:10.950
Afraid of the fires, afraid of the people.

00:44:11.000 --> 00:44:15.950
They aren't going to look for you here.

00:44:16.000 --> 00:44:17.950
Chapter 6.

00:44:18.000 --> 00:44:20.950
Spaceship to the moon.

00:44:21.000 --> 00:44:23.950
And so they waited.

00:44:24.000 --> 00:44:25.950
And waited.

00:44:26.000 --> 00:44:28.950
Rilla slept in her chair.

00:44:29.000 --> 00:44:32.950
Keir and Seru talked quietly.

00:44:33.000 --> 00:44:35.950
Seru's brother came and went.

00:44:36.000 --> 00:44:40.950
Most of the prison guards ran away with the prisoners.

00:44:41.000 --> 00:44:48.950
Seven or eight people, some prisoners and some guards, didn't want to run away.

00:44:49.000 --> 00:44:54.000
So they came into the room and waited too.

00:44:55.000 --> 00:44:56.950
Ten o'clock came.

00:44:57.000 --> 00:44:58.950
Then eleven o'clock.

00:44:59.000 --> 00:45:01.950
It was very quiet.

00:45:02.000 --> 00:45:05.950
Seru walked up and down the room.

00:45:06.000 --> 00:45:08.950
Keir sat next to Rilla.

00:45:09.000 --> 00:45:13.950
Seru's brother came into the room again.

00:45:14.000 --> 00:45:17.950
It's after midnight, he said.

00:45:18.000 --> 00:45:22.950
Just then, they heard the noise of a plane.

00:45:23.000 --> 00:45:24.950
Keir stood up.

00:45:25.000 --> 00:45:26.950
Come on, he said.

00:45:27.000 --> 00:45:30.950
Let's get out of the building.

00:45:31.000 --> 00:45:33.950
Quietly, they left the building.

00:45:34.000 --> 00:45:37.950
It was a dark, hot night.

00:45:38.000 --> 00:45:44.950
There were no guards in front of the prison, so they went to the gate and waited there.

00:45:45.000 --> 00:45:48.950
Suddenly, they saw the plane.

00:45:49.000 --> 00:45:55.950
It was a little plane, and it came down on the road in front of the prison.

00:45:56.000 --> 00:45:58.950
Rilla took Keir's hand.

00:45:59.000 --> 00:46:01.950
You were right, she said.

00:46:02.000 --> 00:46:03.950
I'm sorry.

00:46:04.000 --> 00:46:06.950
Keir smiled.

00:46:07.000 --> 00:46:09.950
He began to feel happy.

00:46:10.000 --> 00:46:13.950
That's all right, I understand.

00:46:14.000 --> 00:46:18.950
I know I die very well, and you don't.

00:46:19.000 --> 00:46:23.950
The plane stopped, and someone opened the door.

00:46:24.000 --> 00:46:26.950
Keir ran across to the plane.

00:46:27.000 --> 00:46:29.950
How many can you take, he called?

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:32.950
There are twelve of us.

00:46:33.000 --> 00:46:35.950
That's all right, someone said.

00:46:36.000 --> 00:46:38.950
Quickly, the spaceship is waiting.

00:46:39.000 --> 00:46:44.950
The twelve people got into the little plane, and the plane began to move.

00:46:45.000 --> 00:46:48.950
Rilla looked at the captain of the plane.

00:46:49.000 --> 00:46:51.950
He was tall with brown hair.

00:46:52.000 --> 00:46:53.950
He looked nice.

00:46:54.000 --> 00:46:57.950
Was this the famous commander or die?

00:46:58.000 --> 00:46:59.950
Where is the spaceship?

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:01.950
Keir asked.

00:47:02.000 --> 00:47:05.950
At the old airport, the man said,

00:47:06.000 --> 00:47:10.950
One of the fires is moving very quickly across the new forest.

00:47:11.000 --> 00:47:17.950
It's going to arrive at the west of Kisangarni before tomorrow, I think.

00:47:18.000 --> 00:47:21.950
But the old airport is okay.

00:47:22.000 --> 00:47:26.950
Then the man looked at Keir and smiled warmly.

00:47:27.000 --> 00:47:29.950
My brother, he said,

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:35.950
My little brother in prison 888.

00:47:36.000 --> 00:47:39.950
Your brother, commander or die?

00:47:40.000 --> 00:47:41.950
Rilla asked.

00:47:42.000 --> 00:47:44.950
But you didn't tell me that?

00:47:45.000 --> 00:47:46.950
Keir smiled.

00:47:47.000 --> 00:47:49.950
Nobody knew, he said.

00:47:50.000 --> 00:47:53.950
But now, it doesn't matter now.

00:47:54.000 --> 00:47:57.950
Everyone can know.

00:47:58.000 --> 00:48:03.950
The little plane came down at the old airport, south of the town.

00:48:04.000 --> 00:48:05.950
Let's be careful,

00:48:06.000 --> 00:48:07.950
Adai said.

00:48:08.000 --> 00:48:11.950
We don't want someone to shoot us before we leave.

00:48:12.000 --> 00:48:14.950
The spaceship was dark.

00:48:15.000 --> 00:48:22.950
Quickly, everyone jumped down from the plane and ran across to the spaceship.

00:48:23.000 --> 00:48:30.950
Soon, the spaceship left Earth, and everyone looked down at the burning planet.

00:48:31.000 --> 00:48:34.950
They saw the dark smoke of Africa.

00:48:35.000 --> 00:48:42.950
And here and there, through the smoke, the red, angry fires.

00:48:43.000 --> 00:48:49.950
The fires are destroying the forest very quickly, Saru said.

00:48:50.000 --> 00:48:53.950
Adai put his hand on Keir's arm.

00:48:54.000 --> 00:48:58.950
I'm sorry about Zadak, he said.

00:48:59.000 --> 00:49:02.950
I wanted him to wait, Keir said.

00:49:03.000 --> 00:49:06.950
I wanted him to talk to you.

00:49:07.000 --> 00:49:09.950
Adai's face was sad.

00:49:10.000 --> 00:49:15.950
He didn't want me to die, he said quietly.

00:49:16.000 --> 00:49:21.950
He was a good man, and now he's dead.

00:49:22.000 --> 00:49:26.950
And Gog is going to Mars, Saru said.

00:49:27.000 --> 00:49:29.950
Mars, he's crazy.

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:35.950
Mars isn't ready for people, Adai said.

00:49:36.000 --> 00:49:41.950
But Gog wants to go, and so he's going, Saru said.

00:49:42.000 --> 00:49:44.950
Tell us about the moon colony.

00:49:45.000 --> 00:49:48.950
That isn't ready, you need more money.

00:49:49.000 --> 00:49:52.950
No, I don't, Adai said.

00:49:53.000 --> 00:49:55.950
The moon colony is ready.

00:49:56.000 --> 00:49:59.950
I asked for more money because of Zadak.

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:04.950
I wanted to give him money for rain, but Gog didn't listen.

00:50:05.000 --> 00:50:10.950
He wanted all Earth's money for the spaceship to Mars.

00:50:11.000 --> 00:50:13.950
I don't want to leave Earth.

00:50:14.000 --> 00:50:15.950
Rilla said sadly.

00:50:16.000 --> 00:50:19.950
She felt tired and afraid.

00:50:20.000 --> 00:50:23.950
Adai smiled warmly at Rilla.

00:50:24.000 --> 00:50:27.950
Nobody wants to leave Earth, he said.

00:50:28.000 --> 00:50:31.950
But under the moon is the best home for us now.

00:50:32.000 --> 00:50:34.950
Wait and see.

00:50:35.000 --> 00:50:39.950
The moon colony is a beautiful, wonderful country

00:50:40.000 --> 00:50:49.950
with rivers and rain, forests and flowers, buildings and the first town.

00:50:50.000 --> 00:50:56.950
You can visit Earth again soon and bring more people to the moon colony.

00:50:57.000 --> 00:51:01.950
We all want to help Earth because it's our first home.

00:51:02.000 --> 00:51:03.950
I know that.

00:51:04.000 --> 00:51:11.950
At the same time, you are going to be happy under the moon.

00:51:12.000 --> 00:51:14.950
Suddenly someone cried.

00:51:15.000 --> 00:51:18.950
Look at the moon!

00:51:19.000 --> 00:51:24.950
And through the window of the spaceship, they saw the moon before them,

00:51:25.000 --> 00:51:28.950
cold, white and beautiful.

00:51:29.000 --> 00:51:35.000
And under the moon, there was the moon colony.
